      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Bro… after connecting all my Gmail accounts to Grok Bot, I don’t even need to open Gmail anymore. Today it cleaned up 2,000+ emails, and all I had to tell it was: “Mark these as read,” “Unsubscribe me from these mailing lists,” “Move these to trash,” or respond with whatever. \n\nI’m literally managing my inbox by texting my bot… thousands of emails cleaned up with a few simple instructions. And unsubscribing means less junk coming in tomorrow, too. This might be my favorite email hack ever. \n\nWhat a game changer.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
